I am standing in the hallway.
I have my shopping list.
I put on my jacket.
Next to the door is a hook.
Two shopping bags hang there.
I take the bags.
The bags in the supermarket cost money.
They are not free.
And I do not like plastic bags.
The way to the supermarket is not short.
I do not have a car.
I walk.
I want to carry my groceries comfortably.
Two bags are practical.
That way, the weight is not too heavy.
I take the key.
I open the door.
I set off.
